<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear>, und getrüw lieb <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydgnoßen</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Üwer</unclear> schryben vom <date resp="#ner">21ten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diß</unclear></date>, sambt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bygelegten</unclear> zytungen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habend</unclear> wir
